# Secrets for the Deploy to Cloudflare button (it asks for each one below).
# For local dev, copy to .dev.vars and see DEPLOY.md → Local development.

# Generate with `node scripts/gen-setup-token.mjs` (32 random bytes, base64url).
# Enter it once at /setup and retain it as a Worker secret: portable installs
# also use it to encrypt their D1-held signing key. Back it up separately.
SETUP_TOKEN=
